WEBVTT

00:00:00.223 --> 00:00:03.694
Copy Paste Explain it again Your A.I.

00:00:03.706 --> 00:00:05.478
is ready so why are you still

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:06.667
moving all the files

00:00:07.665 --> 00:00:10.481
Meet P.C.R.C. It connects your assistant to

00:00:10.493 --> 00:00:11.755
your paired Windows computer

00:00:12.766 --> 00:00:15.654
Run setup Open the pairing link Sign

00:00:15.666 --> 00:00:18.178
in with GitHub match the codes and

00:00:18.226 --> 00:00:19.173
approve access

00:00:20.202 --> 00:00:22.859
Connect P.C.R.C. in your compatible A.I. app

00:00:23.126 --> 00:00:24.995
and keep your computer's agent running

00:00:26.035 --> 00:00:28.778
Now just ask ChatGPT what's in my

00:00:28.778 --> 00:00:31.448
approved workspace Your request travels to your

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:34.020
P.C. and the results come right back

00:00:35.165 --> 00:00:39.147
Find and update files Troubleshoot commands Work

00:00:39.159 --> 00:00:41.961
with supported apps You choose the permissions

00:00:42.965 --> 00:00:46.655
Less copying More doing P.C. Remote Commander

00:00:47.031 --> 00:00:48.269
Try the Windows beta
